<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n24479" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δήν</span></b> , 
			Dor.
		
		<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δάν</span></b>  (or <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δοάν</span></b> 
		<i><span class="en">
			Alcm.
			135
		</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
			A.D.
			<u>Adv.</u>
			160.18
		</span></i>), Adv.
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>for a long while,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Il.
				5.412
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οὐδὲ γὰρ . . δ. ἦν</span> nor
			was he <i>long-lived,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				6.131
			</span></i>,  cf. <i><span class="en">
				16.736
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δ. δὴ . . φίλοι ὦμεν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Thgn.
					1243
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπὶ δ. μετέπειτα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.R.
					1.516
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Euph.
				9.8
			</span></i>; once in Trag., <i><span class="en">
				A.
				<u>Pers.</u>
				584
			</span></i> (lyr.). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>long ago,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δ. οἴχεσθαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Od.
					18.313
				</span></i>
			. (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δοάν,</span>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δϝάν</span>
			, cf. Lat. <i>dudum</i>: hence <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ουδὲ̄
					δ̔ϝ̓<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ήν</span></span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Il.
				16.736
			</span></i>.)</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
